      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TIP TOE FLOW (3) was in the placings last time but three back produced a superb 19.74 win over 366m at this track. Has the ability and expected to go close again. ROCKABYE BABY (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing seventh (31.60) in a Grade 5 at Q Parklands. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Cannot be taken lightly. SASSY SANDY (2) has a strong record this track and trip with four wins and two placings from nine starts. Missed the frame latest (19.95) when fourth over 366m at this track in a Grade 5. Can feature in the finish. SHE'S PEAKIN' (7) jumps at a shorter journey and still warrants respect.",
